.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-10-25T13:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-10-25T13:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">204</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed auto slips.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-10-25T13:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-10-25T18:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2590</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH with 8 1/2&quot; Clean-out bit on 5 1/2&quot; DP from 204 m to 2590 m. Filled pipe every 20 stands. Avg tripping speed: 530 m/hrs.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-10-25T18:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-10-25T19:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2590</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Broke circualtion 1330 lpom, 68 bar and recoreded parameters: up-/down-weight 160 / 120 tons. Free rotating weight 136 tons, 11 - 14 kNm, 25 RPM. Circulated 1500 lpm, 70 bar, 50 RPM while reciprocating string.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-10-25T19:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-10-25T20:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2627</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Washed in hole with 500 lpm, 23 bar from 2590 m to 2624 m without rotation. Took weight @ 2624 m. L/D top single and M/U next stand. R-tagged @ 2624 m with 500 lpm, 23 bar, pulled up 3 m and established drilling parametres 1500 lpm, 65 bar, 60 RPM, 13 - 16 kNm, RIH and dressed TOC from 2624 m to 2627 m. Observed resistance decreasing. Picked up 2 m, stopped rotation and reduced flow to 500 lpm, 23 bar. Continued washing in hole and observed immediate tag @ 2627 m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-10-25T20:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-10-25T21:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2637</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Picked up 3 m to 2624 m and established drilling parameters 2000 lpm, 93 bar, 80 RPM, 14 - 18 kNm. RIH and dressed cement from 2627 m to 2630 m with 2 - 3 tons WOB. Picked off bottom and stopped rotation and reduced flwo to 300 lpm, 17 bar. Tagged TOC with 10 tons. Re-established drilling parameters 2000 lpm, 93 bar, 80 RPM, 14 -18 kNm. RIH and dressed cement from 2630 m to 2637 m with 5 tons WOB. Avg ROP 28 m/hrs.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-10-25T21:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-10-25T22:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2634</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Picked off bottom and circulated bottoms up with 2500 lpm, 126 bar, 80 RPM, 15 - 22 kNm while reciprocating string.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-10-25T22:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-10-25T22:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2637</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Stopped rotation and reduced flow to 300 lpm, 17 bar. RIH and tagged TOC with 10 tons for 2 min 2637 m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-10-25T22:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-10-25T22:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2610</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pumped slug. R/B stand and M/U single joint of 5 1/2&quot; DP.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-10-25T22:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-10-26T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1900</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH with 8 1/2&quot; Clean-out bit from 2610 m to 1900 m. Avg tripping speed: 568 m/hrs.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
